          "author": "Priya Nair",
          "visibility": "internal",
          "created_at": "2026-07-29T08:05:00Z",
          "text": "Query volume is flat. Beacon shows retrieval shard 3 memory at 91% during compaction. Pausing the job brought p95 below 900 ms."
        },
        {
          "id": "cmt_1042_3",
          "author": "Jonah Okafor",
          "visibility": "internal",
          "created_at": "2026-07-29T11:42:00Z",
          "text": "Hypothesis is memory contention from the first 4.18.2 compaction, not yet confirmed. Need a controlled compaction tonight."
        }
